  <compounddef id="Basic-example" kind="example">
    <compoundname>Basic</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Allocate memory from system heap. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Allocate memory from system heap<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>bytes</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of bytes to allocate </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>zeroed</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>If true, zero-initialize the allocated memory (default: false) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Expected&lt;void*&gt; containing pointer to allocated memory or error</para>
</simplesect>
Allocates memory using operator new with the allocator&apos;s default alignment. Uses std::nothrow to avoid exceptions.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Never</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>throws (uses nothrow allocation)</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="retval"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Expected</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>with pointer on success </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Expected</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>with InvalidArgError if bytes is 0 </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Expected</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>with BadAllocError if allocation fails</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
allocation <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">cslt::HeapAllocator<sp/>allocator;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>allocator.alloc(512,<sp/>false);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>(result.hasValue())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>void*<sp/>ptr<sp/>=<sp/>result.value();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>memset(ptr,<sp/>0xAB,<sp/>512);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>allocator.return_element(ptr,<sp/>512,<sp/>allocator.default_alignment());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/>else<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::cerr<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;Allocation<sp/>failed\n&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> <programlisting filename="Basic"></programlisting> </para>
